---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-svh bg-background px-6 py-12 text-foreground">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-8">
      <header class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">elchika-inc/ui</h1>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          elchika-inc の共有 UI コンポーネントです。Base UI と Tailwind CSS v4 を使い、shadcn
          registry で配布します。
        </p>
      </header>

      <nav aria-labelledby="preview-heading">
        <h2 id="preview-heading" class="text-lg font-medium">隔離プレビュー</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring"
              href="/preview/button/"
            >
              Button — light
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring"
              href="/preview/button-dark/"
            >
              Button — dark
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        本格的なカタログはサブプロジェクト #3 で構築します。
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
